cbi.nlm.nih.gov/11502471/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/11502471/</a><br><br><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25056118/\">https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25056118/</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.yourhormones.info/hormones\">https://www.yourhormones.info/hormones</a><br><br><a href=\"https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/articles/22187-cortisol\">https://my.clevelandclinic.org/health/articles/22187-cortisol</a><br><br><a href=\"https://training.seer.cancer.gov/anatomy/reproductive/female/response.html#:~:text=A%20woman%20may%20become%20pregnant,of%20the%20female%20reproductive%20system.\">https://training.seer.cancer.gov/anatomy/reproductive/female/response.html#:~:text=A%20woman%20may%20become%20pregnant,of%20the%20female%20reproductive%20system.</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.drneilspiegel.com/blog/6-important-hormones-and-their-roles-in-your-body\">https://www.drneilspiegel.com/blog/6-important-hormones-and-their-roles-in-your-body</a><br><br><a href=\"https://www.endocrine.org/-/media/endocrine/files/patient-engagement/misc_other/hormone_guide_5x5_grid_25x25_english.pdf\">https://www.endocrine.org/-/media/endocrine/files/patient-engagement/misc_other/hormone_guide_5x5_grid_25x25_english.pdf</a><br><br>https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_human_hormone"
